The complaint was then filed in the court on 08.11.2002, against the appellant (vendor cum proprietor) alleging violation of Section 2(ia),(j) and (m) of PFA Act r/w Rules 23, 28 & 29 of PFA Rules, as punishable under Section 7/16(1A) of PFA.
